ISHA – WhatsApp Web + Recycle Bin Fusion

Mujhe existing ISHA project me ek Tool/Action Fusion System add karna hai.

Goal ye hai ki ISHA ke local GGUF model ko natural-language command samajh aaye aur woh existing OS/browser tool layer ke through appropriate action perform kare.

Do important capabilities add karni hain:

1. WhatsApp Web se kisi contact ko message bhejna
2. System Recycle Bin ko clean/empty karna

Ye dono features existing ISHA architecture ke andar integrate hone chahiye, separate standalone program ke roop me nahi.

---

1. Overall Architecture

Architecture:

User
  ↓
ISHA GUI / Voice
  ↓
Local GGUF Brain
  ↓
Intent / Action Resolver
  ↓
Tool Registry
  ├── WhatsApp Web Tool
  └── Recycle Bin Tool
  ↓
OS / Browser Automation
  ↓
Action Result
  ↓
GGUF
  ↓
Natural-language Response

GGUF model ko directly unrestricted shell commands generate karke execute nahi karne dena.

Instead:

AI
 ↓
Structured Tool Call
 ↓
Validated Tool
 ↓
Permission / Confirmation
 ↓
Execution
 ↓
Result
 ↓
AI

