7. WhatsApp Tool API

Internally structured tool interface rakho.

Concept:

send_whatsapp_message(
    recipient="Rahul",
    message="Hello, kaise ho?"
)

Tool ko validate karna chahiye:

recipient != empty
message != empty
WhatsApp Web available
browser session available

Then action execute ho.

