12. Recycle Bin Tool

Second capability:

Natural-language command:

Recycle Bin clean kar do.

ya:

Recycle Bin empty kar do.

ISHA ko intent detect karna chahiye:

Intent:
empty_recycle_bin

Then OS-specific implementation execute karo.

---

13. Cross-Platform Recycle Bin

Existing ISHA cross-platform architecture ko preserve karo.

Support:

Windows
Linux
macOS

OS detect karke appropriate native mechanism use karo.

Example architecture:

empty_recycle_bin()
       ↓
detect OS
       ↓
Windows → Windows-specific implementation
Linux   → Linux trash implementation
macOS   → macOS trash implementation

Hard-coded Windows command ko Linux par execute mat karo.

---

14. Recycle Bin Safety

Recycle Bin empty karna destructive action hai.

Isliye default behavior:

User:

Recycle Bin clean kar do.

ISHA:

Recycle Bin permanently empty karne wala hoon.
Isse Trash/Recycle Bin ki files permanently remove ho sakti hain.

Kya main continue karun?

User:

Haan

Then action execute karo.

