Most Important Requirements

- Existing ISHA GUI preserve karo.
- Existing GGUF backend preserve karo.
- Existing streaming response preserve karo.
- Existing TTS preserve karo.
- Existing OS/tool system preserve karo.
- WhatsApp Web ko new registered tool ke roop me add karo.
- Recycle Bin ko new registered OS tool ke roop me add karo.
- Arbitrary AI-generated shell commands execute mat karo.
- WhatsApp recipient ambiguity handle karo.
- Recycle Bin ke liye confirmation mandatory/default rakho.
- WhatsApp credentials/password code me store mat karo.
- WhatsApp Web session ko normal browser profile/session ke through maintain karo.
- Cross-platform Recycle Bin implementation rakho.
- Tool execution ke results GGUF ko wapas do.
- Final answer existing GUI streaming + TTS pipeline se deliver karo.

Mujhe sirf demo/mock buttons nahi chahiye. Dono capabilities ko existing ISHA ke actual Tool/Action architecture me functional integration ke roop me implement karo.